  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: **(****√**1st number **+ 1)² × 2** = 2nd number.\n\nNow,\n\nFor 16 : 50\n\n→ (√16 + 1)² × 2\n\n→ (4 + 1)2 × 2\n\n→ 25 × 2 = 50.\n\nFor 144 : 338 \n\n→ (√144 + 1)2 × 2\n\n→ (12 + 1)2 × 2\n\n→ 169 × 2 = 338.\n\nSimilarly, for **49 : ?**\n\n**→ (√49 + 1)2 × 2**\n\n**→ (7 + 1)2 × 2**\n\n**→ 64 × 2 = 128.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
